OL,3,GNEWSABid to remember Force 135 leader
OL,4,Abehind liberation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign to help remember a
OL,7,F"significant World War Two commander"
OL,8,Fis under way after his final resting
OL,9,Fplace was discovered earlier this year.
OL,11,FBrig Alfred Snow was the senior British
OL,12,Fofficer responsible for the liberation
OL,13,Fof the Channel Islands in 1945 after
OL,14,Ffive years of Nazi rule.
OL,16,FThe location of his final resting place
OL,17,Fremained unknown until earlier this
OL,18,Fsummer, when it was discovered his
OL,19,Fashes had been scattered in Taunton,
OL,20,FSomerset.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
